Package: usbforge
Version: 1.2.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0, xorriso
Recommends: grub-common, grub-pc-bin, mtools, pkexec, curl | wget | python3, parted, dosfstools, rsync, wimtools
Maintainer: USBForge Contributors <usbforge@localhost>
Description: Bootable ISO builder and Live USB Lab
 USBForge creates bootable media (including Windows ISOs to USB), builds
 USBForge ISOs, and provides a Live USB Lab GUI for testing and docs.
 Includes menu launchers, icons, and an updater (usbforge-update).
Homepage: https://github.com/Kkkppmm/UBS
